# Deployment Guidelines

## Infrastructure Setup
The framework includes infrastructure configurations in [Infra/](mdc:Infra/):
- [Infra/docker-compose.yml](mdc:Infra/docker-compose.yml) - Docker container orchestration
- [Infra/nginx/](mdc:Infra/nginx/) - Nginx configuration files
- [Infra/env/](mdc:Infra/env/) - Environment-specific configurations

## Environment Configuration
- Development: Use [Infra/env/.env.dev](mdc:Infra/env/.env.dev)
- Production: Use [Infra/env/.env.prod](mdc:Infra/env/.env.prod)
- Configure appropriate database connections
- Set proper security settings
- Configure logging levels

## Docker Deployment
The framework supports containerized deployment:
- [Services/php-app/Dockerfile](mdc:Services/php-app/Dockerfile) - PHP application container
- [Services/frontend/Dockerfile](mdc:Services/frontend/Dockerfile) - Frontend service container
- [Services/node-api/Dockerfile](mdc:Services/node-api/Dockerfile) - Node.js API container
- [Services/python-api/Dockerfile](mdc:Services/python-api/Dockerfile) - Python API container

## Microservices Architecture
The framework uses a microservices approach:
- **PHP App**: Main application logic
- **Frontend**: User interface and client-side logic
- **Node API**: JavaScript-based API services
- **Python API**: Python-based API services

## Deployment Process

### Pre-deployment Checklist
- Run all tests successfully
- Update version numbers
- Review security configurations
- Backup current deployment
- Validate environment configurations

### Deployment Steps
1. Build Docker containers
2. Deploy to staging environment
3. Run integration tests
4. Deploy to production
5. Monitor deployment health
6. Verify functionality

### Post-deployment Validation
- Check application health
- Verify database connectivity
- Test critical user flows
- Monitor error logs
- Validate performance metrics

## Backup and Recovery
- Implement automated database backups
- Backup configuration files
- Store backups in secure locations
- Test recovery procedures
- Document recovery processes

## Monitoring and Logging
- Use [Brain/Classes/logging/Logger.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/logging/Logger.php)
- Implement application monitoring
- Set up error tracking
- Monitor performance metrics
- Configure alert systems

## Security Considerations
- Use HTTPS in production
- Implement proper firewall rules
- Regular security updates
- Monitor for vulnerabilities
- Implement access controls

## Performance Optimization
- Configure caching mechanisms
- Optimize database queries
- Use CDN for static assets
- Implement load balancing
- Monitor resource usage

## Scaling Considerations
- Design for horizontal scaling
- Implement database sharding
- Use caching layers
- Monitor resource utilization
- Plan for traffic spikes

## Maintenance Procedures
- Regular security updates
- Database maintenance
- Log rotation and cleanup
- Performance monitoring
- Backup verification

## Disaster Recovery
- Implement backup strategies
- Document recovery procedures
- Test recovery processes
- Maintain off-site backups
- Plan for business continuity